            "reviewBody": "I made this using 1 1/2 C both brown sugar and butter for extra toffee to cover crackers nicely because 1C recipe was a little thinner than I preferred. Also used white chocolate chips and holiday sugar to decorate for holiday season. My family loves this recipe!",
