              "name": "StaceyQp"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I accidentally grabbed a box of honey wafers instead of the graham crackers I was going to use. To combat the sweetness I knew the dessert would have, once I poured my caramel on the crackers I sprinkled fresh cracked sea salt over everything, then popped it in the oven. I liked the idea of the saltines, but I wanted a better quality base than that. I think salted caramel is the answer folks!",
